# PROJECT: ZARIFLY – PREMIUM ISLAMIC FASHION E-COMMERCE WEB APPLICATION

Act as a world-class UI/UX designer, senior full-stack developer, e-commerce architect, payment integration specialist, and SEO expert.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, production-ready, premium e-commerce web application for **ZARIFLY**, a boutique Islamic fashion and hijab manufacturing brand.

This is not a basic template website. Build a sophisticated, visually stunning, fully responsive, fast, secure, conversion-focused e-commerce platform with a complete backend, admin dashboard, product management, order management, payment gateway, image management, and bilingual support.

IMPORTANT: Do not build just a frontend demo. All major features must work with real backend integration and persistent database storage.

